  "body": "Hi folks,\n\nPython switch to a more reliable and solid alternative to the usual default pip way to manage package dependencies through requirements.txt flat file with the [PEP 518](https://peps.python.org/pep-0518/) and [PEP 621](https://peps.python.org/pep-0621/) support.\n\nWould you be open to use [UV](https://docs.astral.sh/) and consequently the pyproject.toml + lock file in order to gain repeatability and portability of this project repository?\n\nAs usual, feel free to tell me if you need further information!\n\nThanks a lot.",
